    "id": "lem:compatible-lift-completed-cover",
    "kind": "lemma",
    "statement": "Suppose \\(p_0\\in\\operatorname{relint}(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{ASC}})\\) and \\(\\operatorname{im}(B)\\subseteq\\operatorname{lin}(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{ASC}}-p_0)\\).  Under the completed branch construction in \\(\\mathcal B_0\\), every \\(u\\in\\mathbb R^d\\) belongs to some feasible optimal tangent cell \\(P_{v,b}^0\\).  Consequently,\n\\[\n \\bigcup_{v\\in V}D_v^0=\\mathbb R^d.\n\\]",
